{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:33.158Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"span","marks":["p0"],"text":"https://x.com/So_to9/status/1991706450314588168?t=Pz2gJjKcwiJjQELOgcqCrQ&s=19"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"link","href":"https://x.com/So_to9/status/1991706450314588168?t=Pz2gJjKcwiJjQELOgcqCrQ&s=19"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The AI scene has progressed so fast I can't keep up... Even if you try the cutting-edge stuff today, something different will probably be out by next week. It's like catching a cold, sleeping it off, and waking up in a different world (?)."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"p6","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"最近\nいや、別に話についていけないわけではなく、どちらかというと変化が予測可能なので、「ああ、まあそうなるよね」ってなってわざわざ自分から追っかけるのをやめた感じ。なのかな"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"LLMs, image generation, and other advances are happening so fast that keeping up has become a hassle.","emoji":"🤖","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":false,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z","title":"On Not Being Able to Keep Up with Recent AI Advances","translation":{"automatic":true,"sourceId":"01M3TQXT61BM6WTD98ZQF0NJH1"}},"id":"01M3TQXX36TB25SAM6FVRF7MCF","locale":"en","publishedAt":"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"recent-ai-trends","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98","label":"Miscellaneous","locale":"en","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"misc","translationGroup":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9TWK808PYTPW2A7ZZ12Z","label":"llm","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"llm","translationGroup":"01M40J9TWK808PYTPW2A7ZZ12Z"}]},"translationGroup":"01M3TQXT61BM6WTD98ZQF0NJH1"}
